{
  "title": "Interdigital (Morton's) Neuroma",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/foot-and-ankle/7041/interdigital-mortons-neuroma",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Oct 15 2025",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Interdigital Neuromas, also known as Morton's neuroma, is a compressive neuropathy of the interdigital nerve that often leads to plantar forefoot pain.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis is made clinically with tenderness over the plantar aspect of the involved webspace with a palpable neuroma and a positive Mulder's click on examination.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is a trial of nonoperative management with a wide shoe box with metatarsal pads. Operative management is indicated for patients with persistent symptoms who fail nonoperative management.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "demographics",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "middle-aged females (9:1)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "body location",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "most commonly involves **the 3rd and 4th interdigital nerves between the metatarsal heads (3rd webspace)**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Pathophysiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "mechanism of injury",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "not fully understood",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "compression/tension of the interdigital nerve around the **transverse intermetatarsal ligament**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "4",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "repetitive microtrauma",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "3",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "pathoanatomy",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "perineural fibrosis and entrapment of the interdigital nerve",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Anatomy",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Interdigital nerve",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "location",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "lies plantar to the **transverse intermetatarsal ligament between the** metatarsal heads",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "components",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**confluence branches of the lateral and medial plantar nerves**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [
                    {
                      "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/7041/images/mortons.jpg",
                      "caption": "medial branch of LPN and lateral branch of MPN merge and share a common perineum"
                    }
                  ],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Presentation",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Symptoms",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "pain",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "worse with weight-bearing or wearing **narrow toe box shoes** (e.g. high heels)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "relief of symptoms by removing shoes and massaging foot",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "paresthesia",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "most commonly on the plantar aspect of web space",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Physical exam",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "palpation",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "neuroma may be palpable",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**positive web-space compression test**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "provocative tests",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Mulder's click",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "bursal click may be elicited by squeezing metatarsals together",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "3",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "Drawer test at metatarsal phalangeal joint (MTPJ)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "assess for MTPJ instability",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "3",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Imaging",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Radiographs",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "recommended views",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "weight bearing AP/lateral/oblique views",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "findings",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "usually normal",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "may see bony deformity",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ultrasound",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "indication",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "non-palpable neuroma with clear clinical presentation",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "findings",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**oval, hypoechoic mass oriented parallel to the metatarsal bones**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "outcomes",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "highly operator dependent",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MRI",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "indication",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "not usually required for diagnosis",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "may be used to rule out other pathologies",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Studies",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "**Common digital nerve block**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "indication",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "confirmatory for accurate diagnosis of interdigital neuroma",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "findings",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "numbness over lateral surface of toe with relief of patient reported pain",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Differential",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "**MTP synovitis**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "consider if there is no relief of pain after well positioned digit nerve block",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metatarsalgia",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Stress fracture",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "MTPJ arthritis",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Metatarsal head osteonecrosis",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Neoplasm",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Lumbar radiculopathy",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Treatment",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Nonoperative",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "wide shoe box with firm sole and metatarsal pad",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "indications",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "first line of treatment",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "outcomes",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "results are unpredictable",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "text": "approximately 20% of patients will have complete resolution of symptoms",
                          "table": null,
                          "images": [],
                          "importance": "2",
                          "children": []
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "adding anti-inflammatory medications rarely provide any benefit",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "corticosteroid injection",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "indications",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "symptomatic benefit",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "2",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "modality",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "usually approached dorsal after isolating the neuroma with palpation or ultrasound",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "2",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "outcomes",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "evidence for its effectiveness is weak",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "2",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "suggested to provide symptomatic benefit in short term randomized control studies",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "2",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Operative",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "neurectomy",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "indications",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "failure of nonoperative management",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "techniques",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "dorsal or plantar approach (dorsal most common)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "neurectomy with nerve burial (bury proximal stump within intrinsic muscles)",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "transverse intermetatarsal ligament release",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Technique",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "**Dorsal neurectomy**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "approach",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "3 to 4 cm incision just proximal to the involved webspace",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "blunt dissection to avoid injury to branches of superficial peroneal nerve",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "technique",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "spread the metatarsal bones to visualize the webspace, as well as tension the transverse intermetatarsal ligament",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "protecting the neurovacular bundle, transect the transverse intermetatarsal ligament",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "identify the interdigital nerve proximal and distal to the nerve bifurcation",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "resect the nerve at least 3 cm proximal to intermetatarsal ligament",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "reapproximate and repair the transverse intermetatarsal ligament to avoid intermetatarsal head instability",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "2",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Complications",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "**Stump neuroma**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "causes include",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**inadequate retraction (traction neuritis)**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "caused by tethering of plantar neural branches that prevent retraction following resection",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "**inadequate resection** (not proximal enough)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "most common",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "nerve should be resected at least 3 cm proximal to intermetatarsal ligament",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "resect through plantar or dorsal incision",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "2",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "**Painful plantar scar**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "increased risk (5%) with plantar incision",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "2",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
